    "created_at": "2016-10-07T17:50:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-07T17:50:50Z",
    "body": "Note that this came up mainly because we [came across](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=609363#c9) a real site which expected to be able to invoke `HTMLMediaElement.play()` on `touchend` and `pointerup` listeners.  We accidentally broke that site when pointer events was enabled.  So having `pointerup` have at least the same status as `touchend` here is required for web compat.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
