    "created_at": "2016-10-07T17:51:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-07T17:51:26Z",
    "body": "Fair enough. I'll work on adding the reference if we agreed on adding the change here as-is. Regarding when pointerup is fired, it does include mouseup but it also includes the touch interactions for example when user taps.\n",
