    "created_at": "2016-10-07T18:08:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-07T18:08:48Z",
    "body": "I guess that depends on how your read the \"queued by\" clause.  The way I see it, tapping the touchscreen queues separate tasks for trusted `touchend`, `pointerup` and `click` event listeners. Our bug was that we had the \"triggered by user activation\" behavior from the tasks running `touchend` and `click` listeners but not the tasks running the `pointerup` listeners, and that broke a website that expected otherwise.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "reactions": {
