    "created_at": "2016-10-07T18:11:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-07T18:11:17Z",
    "body": "Ah, I see, this comes down to the fact that UI events doesn't actually define a processing model, so we have no idea how many tasks are queued :(. I wonder which browsers queue one task vs. many.\n\nIf some browsers are queuing a task per event, then presumably that list needs to be dramatically expanded...\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
